// English copy for the concept sheets (`art/*.svg`).
//
// The sheets are drawings with fixed layouts, so English is generated by
// swapping the Chinese strings in the built SVG rather than by re-laying out
// the drawings: every <text> element, the slider aria-labels on sheet 06, and
// the three script literals sheet 06's live readout rebuilds while dragging.
// Numbers come from `sim/` either way and are never touched.
//
//   node tools/gen-art.mjs --en        every sheet, Chinese + English side by side
//   node tools/gen-art.mjs 02 --en     only sheet 02
//
// A value is the English string, or `{ t, size }` where the English runs long
// and the element's font-size is pulled down to fit. Keep translations terse:
// most labels sit in fixed boxes drawn for Chinese, and English is wider.
// `node tools/sheet-png.mjs <nn>` rasterises a sheet so the fit can be looked at.
